  "permanent_motion": "The kraft background has a very slow, continuous scale up (1.0 to 1.05 over 7 seconds). A subtle film grain overlay shifts randomly every frame. The central document has a micro-rotation breathing effect (+/- 0.2 degrees) to feel organically placed.",
